{
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside1-7168": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，嗨！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside1-7169": "ALEXANDRA: 啊，您好！不好意思，我就是又看到店里，太高兴了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside1-7170": "OLD WOMAN: 嗯，生意照做，你们欣家的人可没那么容易被打倒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside1-7171": "OLD WOMAN: 不过，你舅舅看起来倒是被这些事折腾得憔悴了些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside1-7172": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，这些是我的朋友。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside1-7173": "OLD WOMAN: 哎呀，真好！看着都挺气派呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside1-7174": "ALEXANDRA: 大家进来吧！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside2-7175": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，嗨！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside2-7176": "ALEXANDRA: 啊，您好！不好意思，我就是又看到店里，太高兴了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside2-7177": "OLD WOMAN: 嗯，生意照做，你们欣家的人可没那么容易被打倒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside2-7178": "OLD WOMAN: 不过，你舅舅看起来倒是被这些事折腾得憔悴了些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside2-7179": "ALEXANDRA: 哦，这些是我的朋友。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside2-7180": "OLD WOMAN: 哎呀，真好！看着都挺气派呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-serenReturnOutside2-7181": "ALEXANDRA: 大家进来吧！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-uturnScript-7182": "NIKOLAI: 我们需要那孩子。她很有本事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-uturnScript-7183": "CORDELIA: 虽然不想打扰，可也不能就这样留下她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-uturnScript-7184": "JUNA: 等等！要走也得先带上亚历……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-uturnScript-7185": "BEN: 先看看那孩子吧。吃东西可以晚点再说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-uturnScript-7186": "AGATA: 或许该先去看看亚历珊德拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-uturnScript-7187": "JEROME: 我想，亚历珊德拉刚才的话，就算是请我们进去做客了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-uturnScript-7188": "ZIKARON: ……同伴……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alvinCh11-7189": "ALVIN: 亚历，我原本不信，可你说得对。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alvinCh11-7190": "ALVIN: 听着，要是有人能找到她，那一定是你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7191": "ALEXANDRA: 路易舅舅！我回来啦！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7192": "LOUIS: 亚历！天哪！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7193": "ALEXANDRA: 您还好吗？一切怎么样？对不起，我没能——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7194": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7195": "ALVIN: 嗨，亚历。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7196": "ALEXANDRA: 你……没在监狱里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7197": "ALVIN: 你这是高兴，还是失望？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7198": "ALEXANDRA: 我当然高兴，只是……我是说，我离开城里的时候……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7199": "ALEXANDRA: 对不起。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7200": "ALVIN: 哦，没什么，你离开城里是对的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7201": "ALVIN: 大陪审团那边没有可靠的证人出庭，他们就准许我在家软禁了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7202": "ALVIN: 我说自己得留在家里照顾妈妈，法官同意了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7203": "ALEXANDRA: 她怎么样？有起色吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7204": "ALVIN: 呃……算是有点变化？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7205": "ALVIN: 别！亚历，等等。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7206": "ALEXANDRA: 怎么了？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7207": "ALVIN: 她……不在楼上。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7208": "ALEXANDRA: 她在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7209": "ALVIN: 我们还在找。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7210": "ALEXANDRA: 什么！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7211": "ALEXANDRA: 阿尔文，你怎么能把昏迷不醒的亲妈给弄丢了！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7212": "ALVIN: 我们也不知道，不过没有人闯进来的痕迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7213": "ALVIN: 路易舅舅上楼去看她，她就已经不见了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7214": "ALEXANDRA: 那她到底在哪儿！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7215": "ALVIN: 亚历，你经历了什么？你变了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7216": "ALEXANDRA: 回答我，阿尔文！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7217": "ALVIN: 她大概在城里某家照护院，我的律师觉得是检察官把她藏了起来，想在审判前给我施压。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7218": "ALEXANDRA: 也就你了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7219": "ALEXANDRA: 也只有你能惹出这种麻烦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7220": "ALVIN: 说得真好听，亚历。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7221": "ALVIN: 这么久以来，妈妈待在这里的开销都是谁出的，你忘了是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7222": "ALVIN: 你要真有人家说的一半聪明，早就该听医生的话，让妈妈走了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7223": "ALVIN: 对不起，我不是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7224": "ALVIN: 我也想让妈妈醒过来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7225": "ALVIN: 她甚至都没那么喜欢我！我只是想让你们俩重新团聚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7226": "ALVIN: 可不是想想就能成的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7227": "ALEXANDRA: 我要去看看她的房间，也许能发现什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7228": "ALVIN: 等等，带走她的人在楼上动了些古怪的手脚，想吓唬我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7229": "ALEXANDRA: 什么意思？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7230": "ALVIN: 没固定住的东西会往妈妈房间里跑，自己就会跑过去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7231": "ALVIN: 还有怪声，冷风。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7232": "ALVIN: 要是在楼上睡觉，那些噩梦……根本不正常。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7233": "ALEXANDRA: 噩梦？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7234": "ALEXANDRA: 梦里是不是有个男人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7235": "ALEXANDRA: 除了眼睛，全身都笼罩在阴影里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7236": "ALVIN: 对，你怎么知道？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7237": "ALEXANDRA: 是他，是他带走了我妈妈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7238": "JUNA: 看来得把这件事跟其他人说清楚了，是吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7239": "ALEXANDRA: 总之，不管他是谁……我本来以为他是个幽灵。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7240": "ALEXANDRA: 可幽灵没办法把我妈妈偷走，对吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7241": "CORDELIA: 当然不行，任何被唤回的亡者，都不可能凭自己的力量如此自如地行动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7242": "CORDELIA: 那人一定是个活着的法师，不过无论如何，很快就能知道了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7243": "ALEXANDRA: 话说，这些机器都是干什么的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7244": "JEROME: 一部分是医疗设备，其余是勘验设备。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7245": "ALEXANDRA: 真的需要……这么多吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7246": "CORDELIA: 亲爱的，你见过的魔法，大多是求快而不求精的战斗魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7247": "CORDELIA: 魔法体系中的绝大多数法术，都需要慢慢施展、精细操控[oxfordComma /]还得借助专用机械。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7248": "CORDELIA: 既然现在有时间，也有设备，我们就能用更精细的办法，追查那个一直追猎你的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7249": "ALEXANDRA: 我非得睡着不可吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7250": "JEROME: 如果你之前就是靠这种方式接近他的，那就必须如此。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7251": "JEROME: 不过你会很安全，我们控制着睡眠法术，还能看到你在梦里经历的部分情景。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7252": "ALEXANDRA: （但愿别梦到什么丢人的事。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7253": "JEROME: 现在，从十开始倒数。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7254": "ALEXANDRA: 十……九……八……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7255": "ALEXANDRA: 七……六……五……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexShop11-7256": "ALEXANDRA: 四……三……二……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7257": "????: 你怎么来到这里的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7258": "ALEXANDRA: 我循着自己的梦，追到了他这里。就是我在找的那个男人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7259": "ALEXANDRA: 你是谁？你不是我要找的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7260": "????: 我不记得自己的名字了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7261": "????: 如今，我只是他的囚徒。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7262": "????: 不，比囚徒还糟。我不过是件衣服，任由他穿上，再脱下来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7263": "ALEXANDRA: 他在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7264": "????: 我以前的实验室。他正在……重建那里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7265": "????: 不，这个词不对。他从不创造什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7266": "ALEXANDRA: 我妈妈在他手上吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7267": "????: 我不知道。如今他有了我的传送门，几乎可以去任何地方猎捕受害者。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7268": "????: 找到他以后，你打算怎么办？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7269": "ALEXANDRA: 不管要做什么，我都会去做。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7270": "????: 他来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7271": "????: 快走！别让他把你也抓住！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7272": "ALEXANDRA: 我……出了点问题。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7273": "JUNA: 别紧张。他们看到东西了，你看看。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7274": "ALEXANDRA: 对，我见到了他。他是谁？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7275": "AGATA: 据我所知，他已经死了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7276": "ALEXANDRA: 他说，抓走妈妈的人在他以前的……实验室里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7277": "AGATA: 那就知道该去哪儿了。在阿科斯东北方的一个山洞里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7278": "AGATA: 得赶在他有机会准备之前行动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-dreamMagicoScene-7279": "ALEXANDRA: 好……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorSubdue-7280": "HECTOR: 谢谢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorSubdue-7281": "MAGICO: 你做得很好。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorSubdue-7282": "MAGICO: 接下来小心些，他要是还没来，也快到了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtyaSubdue-7283": "AXTYA: 我……自由了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtyaSubdue-7284": "ALEXANDRA: 那么……还剩一个？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtyaSubdue-7285": "MAGICO: 是的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtyaSubdue-7286": "ALEXANDRA: 我很难受，他们不该遭受这些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtyaSubdue-7287": "MAGICO: 别难过，他们不——应该说，我们都已经不算真正活着了，早就不算了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtyaSubdue-7288": "MAGICO: 趁我从前的导师还没反击，快。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-vasilisSubdue-7289": "MAGICO: 谢谢，现在我从前那位导师的藏身处应该已经露出破绽了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-vasilisSubdue-7290": "BEN: 我这辈子见过不少烂人，可这个拉涅特斯，真得单独拿出来说说。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-vasilisSubdue-7291": "CORDELIA: 我知道，你们的法律禁止这类魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-vasilisSubdue-7292": "CORDELIA: 可即使有法律禁止，这种人竟然还能如此猖獗……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-vasilisSubdue-7293": "AGATA: 我们没法同时管到世界的每个角落。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-vasilisSubdue-7294": "JUNA: 赶紧离开这鬼地方吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-vasilisSubdue-7295": "ALEXANDRA: 她说得对，走吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7296": "<align=\"center\">我没能……</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7297": "<align=\"center\">我什么都没有了……</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7298": "<align=\"center\">妈妈？</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7299": "<align=\"center\">你也在这下面吗？</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7300": "<align=\"center\">什么？这是哪……</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7301": "ALEXANDRA: 在、在哪……咳咳……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7302": "ALEXANDRA: 我在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7303": "????: 你在一处依附于星界的幽暗之地。他把压制住的人格囚禁在这里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7304": "ALEXANDRA: 是你！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7305": "ALEXANDRA: 什么……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7306": "????: 想伤害我是没有意义的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7307": "????: 我几乎没有实体……仅剩的一点力量，也只够把你从那个容器里放出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7308": "????: 况且，袭击你的人不是我。我也只是他的一个人格。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7309": "ALEXANDRA: 你想干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7310": "????: 帮你逃出去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7311": "????: 拉涅特斯虽然夺走了你的身体，你却依然能在星界中显现。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7312": "????: 这就说明还有出路。我们可以反击他，也能救你的母亲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-alexBanishFall-7313": "????: 这边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoRebornIntro-7314": "ALEXANDRA: 就是这里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoRebornIntro-7315": "BEN: 对，没错，就是那个魔法佬的老窝。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoRebornIntro-7316": "BEN: 说真的，这地方比我想的还完整。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoRebornIntro-7317": "BEN: 不过，肯定有什么不一样了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoRebornIntro-7318": "AGATA: 留意陷阱。以前的主人法力没这么强，这里就已经很危险了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoRebornIntro-7319": "AGATA: 谁知道现在多了些什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesFirstTeleportScene-7320": "ALEXANDRA: 这是什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesFirstTeleportScene-7321": "CORDELIA: 模样虽不怎么雅观，但应该是一道扩张之门。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesFirstTeleportScene-7322": "BEN: 什么门？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesFirstTeleportScene-7323": "CORDELIA: 魔法可以将微小的“口袋”空间扩张，变得大得多。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesFirstTeleportScene-7324": "CORDELIA: 这样就能在两地间开辟一条临时通道。不过，能量利用率不高，也不会缩短实际行进的距离。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesFirstTeleportScene-7325": "BEN: 我可没看到别的路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesFirstTeleportScene-7326": "ALEXANDRA: 我们不能就这样……跳进去……吧？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesFirstTeleportScene-7327": "ALEXANDRA: 万一是陷阱呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesFirstTeleportScene-7328": "CORDELIA: 扩张之门失去魔力后，会缓缓坍缩，只会将其中的人弹回正常空间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesFirstTeleportScene-7329": "CORDELIA: 这里或许有陷阱，但扩张之门本身不会是。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7330": "ALEXANDRA: 嗯？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7331": "ALEXANDRA: 其他人呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7332": "MAGICO: 你知道把阿克提娅的联结术用在人身上，有什么麻烦吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7333": "MAGICO: 想制服他们，就免不了伤到自己。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7334": "LANETES: 所以，得让别人替你制服他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7335": "ALEXANDRA: 不、不要！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7336": "ALEXANDRA: 那是什么！？你对我做了什么！？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7337": "ALEXANDRA: 我的手没知觉了……什么都感觉不到了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7338": "LANETES: 玛丽给了我那么多好用的东西……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7339": "LANETES: 可没有什么比得上这具身体。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7340": "LANETES: 我能感觉到大地之力在万物间奔流，而它只属于我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7341": "\"ALEXANDRA\": 啊，你们在这儿！刚才不好意思啦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7342": "\"ALEXANDRA\": 应该走这边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7343": "ALEXANDRA: 不！那不是我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7344": "ALEXANDRA: 不！等等！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7345": "ALEXANDRA: 回来！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesTrapScene-7346": "LANETES: （至于你……）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoWarning-7347": "MAGICO: 你进了他的领地？真傻，不过至少你带了同伴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoWarning-7348": "ALEXANDRA: 我妈妈在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoWarning-7349": "MAGICO: 你妈妈在我从前的导师手上，想打败他，得先制服他的三个化身。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoWarning-7350": "MAGICO: 只要还拥有这些化身，他就几乎不可战胜。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoWarning-7351": "MAGICO: 第一个是赫克托，就在前面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoWarning-7352": "MAGICO: 祝你好运。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7353": "HECTOR: 就这点本事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7354": "HECTOR: 来点像样的挑战。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7355": "PHYLAKE: 够了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7356": "PHYLAKE: 你受过什么训练？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7357": "HECTOR: 我在体院跟过一个教练，不过练了几年，就自己出来闯了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7358": "PHYLAKA: 你的技法很差。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7359": "HECTOR: 可我还是把你们最厉害的人都打败了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7360": "PHYLAKA: 那不是我们最厉害的人，不过我明白你的意思。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7361": "PHYLAKE: 拉涅特斯大师，您怎么看？他会不会有什么特殊力量？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7362": "LANETES: 有可能，每个时代都有可信的记载，说某些战士做出了常人不可能做到的壮举。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7363": "LANETES: 就连古代法师也曾怀疑，魔法或许会以超凡的力量与耐力显现。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7364": "PHYLAKE: 他就像古代的英雄？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7365": "LANETES: 也许吧，还需要进一步测试。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7366": "HECTOR: 那可得给够报酬。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorStart-7367": "HECTOR: 想请我出力的人多着呢。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorCapture-7368": "HECTOR: 还真有人蠢到敢闯我的家？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorCapture-7369": "HECTOR: 老兄，你找错人了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorCapture-7370": "LANETES: 不。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-hectorCapture-7371": "LANETES: 我可没找错。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7372": "ARCHIAS: 人都齐了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7373": "ARCHIAS: 物资怎么样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7374": "TIMOS: 都顺利运过河了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7375": "OLYMPIAS: 除了我的罗盘。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7376": "NICEAS: 我们还有备用的，再说照着这些地图也挺容易找路。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7377": "ARCHIAS: 他呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7378": "NICEAS: 谁？拉涅特斯？他直接从河面上飘过去了，我看连脚趾都没沾湿。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7379": "NICEAS: 到现在，总算看见他露了一手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7380": "TIMOS: 就是，不帮我们过河就算了，至少也该帮着搬搬测量设备吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7381": "NICEAS: 法师公会到底为什么非让我们带上他来着？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7382": "ARCHIAS: 不是公会让他来的，他自己想见见这个部族。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7383": "ARCHIAS: 为这趟行程，他出了不少钱，路上也用不着我们照顾。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya1-7384": "ARCHIAS: 所以……就尽量跟他相处下去吧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7385": "LANETES: 她叫什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7386": "OLYMPIAS: 她说自己叫阿克提娅。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7387": "LANETES: 她在部族里担任什么职务？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7388": "OLYMPIAS: 她说她是……嗯……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7389": "OLYMPIAS: 这个词不太好译，不过她是部族里的法师之一。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7390": "LANETES: 如果我没弄错，他们用魔法控制兽群，是这样吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7391": "OLYMPIAS: 她说并不是控制，而是他们之间有一种联结。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7392": "OLYMPIAS: 哦……而且不只是和动物。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7393": "OLYMPIAS: 他们还会与元素体联结，让它们跟随在天空中，控制天气。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7394": "LANETES: 当真？他们如何维持这种联结？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7395": "OLYMPIAS: 她说，这种联结……它……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7396": "OLYMPIAS: 抱歉，这些都是很专业的术语，而这种方言我也不太熟。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7397": "OLYMPIAS: 我想，她是说这种联结……能自行维持下去？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7398": "OLYMPIAS: 这是一种只有该部族的女性才能使用的特殊魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7399": "OLYMPIAS: 男子和男孩可以掌握普通魔法，但只有女性能建立这种联结。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7400": "LANETES: 最后一个问题。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7401": "LANETES: 能与另一个人建立这种联结吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7402": "OLYMPIAS: 呃……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7403": "OLYMPIAS: 她……说这是被禁止的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya2-7404": "OLYMPIAS: 她只肯说这些。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya3-7405": "TIMOS: 呃……我需要……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya3-7406": "TIMOS: 拉、拉涅特斯？你没事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya3-7407": "TIMOS: 大家都……我不知道他们是不是死了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya3-7408": "TIMOS: 我不知道发生了什么，是魔法吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya3-7409": "LANETES: 不，不是魔法。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya3-7410": "TIMOS: 是吃的东西有问题？连那些蛮族都……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya3-7411": "LANETES: 是啊，都中招了，就算没全中，也差不多了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya3-7412": "TIMOS: 你在干什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya3-7413": "LANETES: 嘘。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya3-7414": "AXTYA: 好疼……求求你……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya3-7415": "LANETES: 别担心，我需要你的身体完好无损。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-axtya3-7416": "LANETES: 你什么也不会感觉到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesPipeTutorial-7417": "ALEXANDRA: 想从这里过去，应该得先恢复供电。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesPipeTutorial-7418": "ALEXANDRA: 这些是导电管。这一根是固定的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesPipeTutorial-7419": "ALEXANDRA: 但这一根……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesPipeTutorial-7420": "ALEXANDRA: 这些导电管可以转动。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesPipeTutorial-7421": "ALEXANDRA: 只要把电流从电源引到那些没通电的线路上就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoPrelude-7422": "MAGICO: 快到尽头了，他的防御在减弱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoPrelude-7423": "MAGICO: 关于他，有些事你必须知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoPrelude-7424": "MAGICO: 他自称菲利普·拉涅特斯，究竟是真名还是又一重伪装，我也不知道。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoPrelude-7425": "MAGICO: 当初我去找他，是因为阿科斯的学院不准我做自己想做的研究。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoPrelude-7426": "MAGICO: 人们都说他才华横溢……思想不受束缚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoPrelude-7427": "MAGICO: 他与学院和法师公会决裂，在遥远山间的家中授课……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesGathering-7428": "LANETES: 啊，瓦西利斯！真高兴你能来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesGathering-7429": "MAGICO: 我不知道……这些都是您的其他学生？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesGathering-7430": "LANETES: 别担心，这里不像普通学校。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesGathering-7431": "WOMAN: 我们就是为这个才来的！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesGathering-7432": "LANETES: 我的学生可以按自己的需要，随时来去。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesGathering-7433": "LANETES: 每周末，我们会聚在一起，交流各自的心得。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesGathering-7434": "MAN: 导师说，你对魔法工程感兴趣。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesGathering-7435": "MAGICO: 是的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesGathering-7436": "MAN: 想让学院批准那种研究……更别说还要给你资源了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesGathering-7437": "MAN: 我简直想象不出他们会有同意的一天。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoDemonstration-7438": "LANETES: 那么！既然叫我们都来观看，想必你已经攻克了难题？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoDemonstration-7439": "MAGICO: 希望不会让大家失望……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoDemonstration-7440": "LANETES: 非常出色！这样的突破，难怪会让掌权者心生畏惧。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoDemonstration-7441": "MAN: 最远能到哪里？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoDemonstration-7442": "MAN: 需要怎样的能量供应？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoMessageWarp-7443": "<align=\"center\">有一段时间，这位新“导师”确实能教给我一些东西。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoMessageWarp-7444": "<align=\"center\">可当他再也提不出新的见解，我便知道，自己该另辟道路了。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesHouseNotYet-7445": "MAGICO: 还没到。还要再走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoConstruction-7446": "MAGICO: 于是，我开始在偏远的地方建造自己的实验室，避开公会的冷眼。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoConstruction-7447": "MAGICO: 此后多年，我与从前的导师一直有书信往来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoConstruction-7448": "MAGICO: 可渐渐地，他的信越来越混乱，信中那些关于魔法本质的理论，也越来越离谱。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoConstruction-7449": "MAGICO: 同一行字写到一半，笔迹竟会突然大变。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoConstruction-7450": "MAGICO: 后来，我收到一封内容格外古怪的信，便动身去他家找他。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoReturnsHouse-7451": "MAN: 瓦西利斯！你回来了！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoReturnsHouse-7452": "MAGICO: 导师在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoReturnsHouse-7453": "MAN: 认不出我了吗？我就在这儿！你得——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoReturnsHouse-7454": "WOMAN: ——来帮我，瓦西利斯！守护者……大贤者本人！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoReturnsHouse-7455": "MAN: 他们想毁了我！瓦西利斯！我为你做了那么——",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoReturnsHouse-7456": "WOMAN: ——多事，你得可怜可怜我，帮帮我！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesInHouse-7457": "LANETES: 啊，好，好。这边来，瓦西利斯。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesInHouse-7458": "MAGICO: 您是……怎么会……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesInHouse-7459": "LANETES: 他们伤了我……差点杀了我。可联结没有断！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesInHouse-7460": "LANETES: 连另一个世界里的那道也是……这就是我们一直盼望的奇迹！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesInHouse-7461": "LANETES: 不过，我需要你替我做件事，这边来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBasement-7462": "LANETES: 到下面的遗迹去，你得亲眼看看，才能明白真相。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBasement-7463": "LANETES: 看到了，你就会明白。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBasement-7464": "LANETES: 瓦西利斯……？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBasement-7465": "LANETES: 瓦西利斯！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesHouseKid-7466": "LANETES: 下楼，瓦西利斯，快！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesStairsA-7467": "LANETES: 对，这边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesStairsB-7468": "LANETES: 继续，往楼梯下面走。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoDeathRecap-7469": "MAGICO: 我本该察觉从前的导师在我身上留下了魔法印记，可它实在太隐蔽了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-magicoDeathRecap-7470": "MAGICO: 这就是他的本事，总在你没有留神时下手。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesOnPath-7471": "????: 你依然能像往常一样，在星界中穿行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesOnPath-7472": "????: 没理由不相信我。我本可以不放你出来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesOnPath-7473": "????: 况且事到如今，拉涅特斯还能把你怎么样？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesOnPath-7474": "ALEXANDRA: 你为什么这么做？你不是他的一部分吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesOnPath-7475": "????: 事情比这复杂。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesOnPath-7476": "????: 你得明白，拉涅特斯并不只是装成别人。没人能装得那么像。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesOnPath-7477": "????: 他的魔法能让他把受害者像衣服一样穿在身上。用完以后，再将他们丢回黑暗。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesOnPath-7478": "????: 现在快走，别让他发现。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-boardLanetesPlatform-7479": "????: 我们快到拉涅特斯联结法术的核心了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-boardLanetesPlatform-7480": "ALEXANDRA: 你还是没告诉我，为什么要这么做。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-boardLanetesPlatform-7481": "ALEXANDRA: 到底为什么？因为他造出了你，又把你丢在这里，所以你恨他？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-boardLanetesPlatform-7482": "????: 拉涅特斯创造我这个人格，就是要我去爱玛丽、照顾她。他需要我骗她许下承诺。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-boardLanetesPlatform-7483": "????: 有一种法术，能用别人的生命保护自己。受到攻击时，就能汲取对方的生命来维持自身。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-boardLanetesPlatform-7484": "????: 但受害者必须自愿，必须向你许下承诺。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-boardLanetesPlatform-7485": "????: 可玛丽根本不知道魔法是真的，也就不明白那个承诺究竟意味着什么。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-boardLanetesPlatform-7486": "ALEXANDRA: 她就是因为这个才昏迷的？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-boardLanetesPlatform-7487": "ALEXANDRA: 如果我们杀了他，她也会死吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-boardLanetesPlatform-7488": "????: 拉涅特斯创造我，确实是为了让我爱玛丽。但这并不意味着，我对她的爱是假的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-boardLanetesPlatform-7489": "????: 总比任由他继续吸取她的生命好，不是吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7490": "ALEXANDRA: 这是什么地方？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7491": "????: 这里是拉涅特斯最大的秘密，一座希纳尔遗迹。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7492": "????: 这里藏着一种可怕的魔法，让他能够盗取身体，也许还藏着更可怕的东西。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7493": "????: 他果然留了守卫，以你现在的状态，独自迎战恐怕很困难。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7494": "ALEXANDRA: 我不必独自迎战。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7495": "ALEXANDRA: 我们得救妈妈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7496": "ALVIN: 对，一定得救。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7497": "????: 好了，他与那些人格的联结已经断开，你应该能夺回自己的身体了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7498": "ALEXANDRA: 那我妈妈呢？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7499": "????: 我也不知道会怎样，但如果你能压倒他，也许就能救下她。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7500": "ALEXANDRA: 不管用什么办法，我一定会做到。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7501": "ALEXANDRA: 他这种人，就想让你以为一切都掌握在他们手里，而你什么也做不了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7502": "ALEXANDRA: 可这世界根本不是那样的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7503": "????: 亚历珊德拉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7504": "????: 很高兴能遇见你，你很像你的母亲。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7505": "CORDELIA: 亚历珊德拉，我们在这里做什么？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7506": "\"ALEXANDRA\": 呃，那个，等一下，我不想出了差错，害你们受伤。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7507": "JUNA: 亚历……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7508": "\"ALEXANDRA\": 就一下……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7509": "\"ALEXANDRA\": 啊啊啊！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7510": "\"ALEXANDRA\": 不！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7511": "ALEXANDRA: 这是我的身体，你这混蛋！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7512": "LANETES: 任性的小鬼……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7513": "CORDELIA: 刚才那是怎么回事？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7514": "ALEXANDRA: 不重要，我们得去解决那家伙，救出我妈妈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesBinding-7515": "ALEXANDRA: 来吧！他的藏身处就在上面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7516": "BEN: 这气氛，可真让人喜欢不起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7517": "AGATA: 里面那是他原本的身体？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7518": "ALEXANDRA: 对。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7519": "<align=\"center\">别装作你们知道我是什么。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7520": "ALEXANDRA: 闭嘴。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7521": "<align=\"center\">毁了我，会有多少知识随之消失？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7522": "<align=\"center\">阿克提娅的部族已死绝。赫克托的天赋独一无二。我从希纳尔遗迹中发掘的秘密，耗费了一生的研究。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7523": "<align=\"center\">留着我，我能为你们提供的价值远胜于此。</align>",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7524": "CORDELIA: 这真的可行吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7525": "AGATA: 不行。他必须死，否则明天就会冒出十几个他这样的人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7526": "ALEXANDRA: 况且全是鬼话。他不过是在拖延时间，盘算怎么攻击我们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7527": "<align=\"center\">这是你们最后一次讲道理的机会。与我交手，你们之中必有人送命。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7528": "ALEXANDRA: 大部分都是假的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7529": "NIKOLAI: 能分清真假吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7530": "ALEXANDRA: 能。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7531": "BEN: 总算除掉这个祸害了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7532": "CORDELIA: 他的法术正在失效。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7533": "CORDELIA: 这里的结构可能撑不住了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7534": "ALEXANDRA: 你们先走。我得去找妈妈。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7535": "JUNA: 亚历，我们都不知道她是不是在下面。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7536": "ALEXANDRA: 我必须弄清楚。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-lanetesConfrontation-7537": "ALEXANDRA: 真的，我是认真的。别等我。我会找到出路的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7538": "MARIE: 啊，你好！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7539": "MARIE: 不好意思，这里这么乱，我没想到会有客人来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7540": "MARIE: 我是……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7541": "MARIE: 我叫什么来着？刚才差一点就想起来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7542": "MARIE: 哎呀。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7543": "ALEXANDRA: 玛丽？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7544": "MARIE: 对！",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7545": "MARIE: 这阵子，我总是记不住事。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7546": "MARIE: 有一段时间，我什么都想不起来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7547": "MARIE: 不过，在一点一点地想起来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7548": "MARIE: 只要养成好习惯就行。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7549": "MARIE: 昨天我想起来，这些万寿菊需要更多阳光，就把它们从树下搬出来了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7550": "ALEXANDRA: 这……也是你吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7551": "MARIE: 啊，嗯，我想是的，好像有某种联系。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7552": "MARIE: 有个男人来过这里，来过几次。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7553": "MARIE: 他会照顾她，不过做得很敷衍，可每当他照顾她时，我多少也能有一点感觉。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7554": "MARIE: 他从不跟我说话。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7555": "ALEXANDRA: 我得带她回家。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7556": "MARIE: 家？家在哪儿？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7557": "ALEXANDRA: 塞伦。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7558": "ALEXANDRA: 在这上面的世界，那里有太阳，有天空，还有其他人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7559": "ALEXANDRA: 她的家在那里，家人也在那里。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7560": "MARIE: 家人？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7561": "MARIE: 我梦见过他们。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7562": "MARIE: 差一点就能想起他们的模样了……",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7563": "ALEXANDRA: 我会带你离开这里，回到他们身边。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7564": "MARIE: 谢谢你。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7565": "MARIE: 我不知道自己做过什么，值得你这样待我。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7566": "ALEXANDRA: 你做过的。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7567": "NURSE: 她的情况和以前不一样了。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7568": "NURSE: 现在光照时，她的瞳孔会扩张，对触碰和声音也有了些反应。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7569": "ALEXANDRA: 她会醒来吗？",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7570": "NURSE: 这些都是恢复的迹象，但我不能保证会一直好转。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7571": "ALEXANDRA: 谢谢，我哥哥会和您结账，再约好您下次上门的时间。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7572": "NURSE: 好的，孩子。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7573": "ALEXANDRA: 妈妈，我还有件事要做，是为了所有人。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7574": "ALEXANDRA: 我保证，做完就回来。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7575": "ALEXANDRA: 很快再见。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/chapter11/alexSidequest.yarn-marieSaved-7576": "ALEXANDRA: （我手上的印记消失了。）",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3448": "Title: 家人的下落",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3449": "Description: 返回塞伦，探望亚历珊德拉的母亲和哥哥。",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3450": "Title: 再闯险地",
  "line:Assets/Cutscenes/QuestLog.yarn-Evaluate_QuestLog-3451": "Description: 返回本的世界，前往阿科斯东北方堤刻半岛上的魔法佬实验室。"
}
